# A packaging repo holds PKGBUILD, .SRCINFO and install/patch files. Nothing
# else. This tree had the entire build directory committed -- 14 source
# tarballs, makepkg's extracted src/ and staged pkg/, and the built package --
# which is both pointless history and why the first AUR push was rejected
# outright (maximum blob size 488.28KiB).
#
# src/ also carried models/yolov8n.onnx: the detector weights the rest of the
# fleet deliberately does not track, because Ultralytics' weight licensing is
# unresolved. They must not ride along in a packaging repo either.
*.tar.gz
*.tar.zst
*.pkg.tar.*
src/
pkg/
*.bak
*.bak[0-9]
